I want to keep the Forest Service out of this as much as possible =97 and I=
 will. But I cannot pretend that what happened on March 24th didn't happen.=
 That is now part of the record. Special Agent Oliver made that connection,=
 not me. What I can do is make that
 the end of the record rather than the beginning of something larger. That =
is what I want.</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Robot=
