To do that, I need to move. I'm asking you to help me transfer to the Olymp=
ic Peninsula. Anywhere in the Forest Service there. I don't care how remote=
 the campground. I know you would need to coordinate with someone to make i=
t happen, but I believe it's possible
 and I'm asking for your help.</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Robot=
