rgb(0,0,0)">
I had the opportunity to talk with Patrol Officer Felicia Sloan this mornin=
g about the incident you describe in your e-mail.&nbsp; Unfortunately, the =
only information I have relates to the Forest Service and you seem to alrea=
dy have that information- Patrol Officer
 Felicia Sloan and Special Agent Matt Oliver.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>
<div class=3D"x_elementToProof" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFo=
nt,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:=
rgb(0,0,0)">
<br>
</div>
<div class=3D"x_elementToProof" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFo=
nt,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:=
rgb(0,0,0)">
The other two officers were with Oregon State Police. The Oregon State Poli=
ce website has contact information and it should help you find a contact th=
at can point you in the right direction in helping you get the information =
you seek.&nbsp; It's not the specific
 information you are looking for but I am hoping it will help you get those=
 answers.</div>
<div class=3D"x_elementToProof" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFo=
nt,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:=
rgb(0,0,0)">
<br>
</div>
<div class=3D"x_elementToProof" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFo=
nt,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:=
rgb(0,0,0)">
I know you are concerned about your safety and are concerned about the law =
enforcement visit. I want to make sure to let you know that we have an agre=
ement with Lane County Sherriff's Office for the use of the Siltcoos Work C=
enter.&nbsp; They will be there on occasion
 to pick up and drop off ATVs and will be there working on ATVs as needed.&=
nbsp; I don't want you to be caught off guard by their presence.&nbsp;</div=
>
<div class=3D"x_elementToProof" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFo=
nt,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:=
rgb(0,0,0)">
<br>
</div>
<div class=3D"x_elementToProof" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFo=
nt,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:=
rgb(0,0,0)">
