<div style=3D"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-s=
ystem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
My name is Robert Samuel White. I serve as a volunteer caretaker at the Sil=
tcoos Work Center.</div>
<div style=3D"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-s=
ystem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-s=
ystem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
On March 24, 2026 =97 the one-year anniversary of my dismissal from Oregon =
State Parks =97 a U.S. Forest Service Special Agent from the investigative =
branch arrived at the locked gate of this work center with two unidentified=
 state officers. They told me they were
 concerned about what I was posting online. I declined to speak without an =
attorney and closed the door.</div>
<div style=3D"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-s=
ystem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-s=
ystem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
I have since corresponded with Patrol Captain Felicia Sloan. She confirmed =
Agent Oliver's role and assignment. When I asked directly who authorized th=
e visit and what its purpose was, she redirected me to FOIA. When I asked f=
or the identity of the state officers
 who accompanied him, she redirected me to FOIA. She has not answered eithe=
r question.</div>
<div style=3D"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-s=
ystem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-s=
ystem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
I cannot feel safe on this land when a supervisory officer will not tell me=
 who came to my door, who sent them, or why.</div>
<div style=3D"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-s=
ystem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-s=
ystem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
I want to be direct with you. This has been a rewarding year. I grew fond o=
f this place and this institution. I did not want the Forest Service in the=
 record at all. But I am not the one who brought a Forest Service investiga=
tor to my door. That choice was
 made by someone else.</div>
<div style=3D"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-s=
ystem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-s=
ystem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
You issued First Amendment auditor guidance to your staff. That told me eve=
rything about your integrity. I am writing to you now because that same jud=
gment is what this situation still requires.</div>
<div style=3D"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-s=
ystem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-s=
ystem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
I have a right to know who authorized that visit. I have a right to know wh=
o those officers were. And I have a right to feel safe at my federal work c=
enter.</div>
<div style=3D"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-s=
ystem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-s=
ystem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)">
